---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Prose from '../components/Prose.astro';
import { CONTACT } from '../lib/contact';
---
<Base title="Privacy | RentalSpy" description="What RentalSpy collects and how to delete it.">
  <Prose title="Privacy">
    <p class="lede">We collect as little as possible, never sell it, and you can delete it any time.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>A random account ID</b> saved in your browser when you add a place. No name or email is needed.</li>
      <li><b>Your email</b>, only if you choose to add one so you can use your account on another device. It's never shown to anyone.</li>
      <li><b>What you share</b>: the address, rent, ratings, and your optional tip. Other renters see these without any link to you.</li>
      <li><b>Technical logs</b> (such as IP addresses) kept for a short time by our hosting providers for security.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>What we don't do</h2>
    <ul><li>No ads, no tracking cookies, no selling or sharing data for marketing.</li><li>We don't ask for or store leases, bond papers or ID documents.</li></ul>
    <h2>Who stores it</h2>
    <p>Entries are stored with Supabase (database), and the website is hosted by our web host. Maps load from OpenFreeMap. These providers only process data to run the service.</p>
    <h2>Deleting your data</h2>
    <p>Go to <a href="/me/">My places</a> to delete single entries or your whole account. Deleting your account removes everything you've shared.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>{CONTACT ? <>Questions: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT}`}>{CONTACT}</a></> : 'Use the Report a problem page.'}</p>
  </Prose>
</Base>
